The NumPy-target tanh coefficients and scalarized operation order in
code/mlx_backend/hyperbolic_math64.py and hyperbolic32.py derive from NumPy v1.26.4:
https://github.com/numpy/numpy/blob/v1.26.4/numpy/core/src/umath/loops_hyperbolic.dispatch.c.src

